er the surface, light accent ink.","name":"Accent tints — lane pills"},{"path":"guidelines/colors-venture-swatches.card.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"Twelve hues in one mid-saturation band, spaced around the wheel so a 3px card edge is always tellable.","name":"Venture identity swatches"},{"path":"guidelines/colors-venture.card.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x140","subtitle":"Each venture owns one accent; the dot, card edge and lane colour all use it.","name":"Venture identity colours"},{"path":"components/calendar/calendar.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x340","subtitle":"Venture-coloured events, violet note flags, looping teal sync pulse","name":"Calendar — week, events, sync bar"},{"path":"components/chrome/chrome.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x400","subtitle":"AppBar with the + New venture action; PageHeader bare (Pipeline) and with a KPI cluster; BackStrip; StatStrip","name":"Chrome — bar, back strip, header"},{"path":"components/data/data.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x380","subtitle":"FactRow, LinkChip, ChecklistRow, LaneBarRow, LineRow, ActivityRow","name":"Data — facts, checklist, lane bars, activity"},{"path":"components/decisions/decisions.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x300","subtitle":"Collapsed and expanded DecisionRow, SourceChip backlink, ActionButton","name":"Decisions — rows, source chips, action"},{"path":"components/docs/docs.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x360","subtitle":"FileRow grid, expanded VersionRow stack, FolderFilter, DropZone, PreviewPanel","name":"Docs — file rows, versions, drop zone"},{"path":"components/forms/forms.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x290","subtitle":"TextField rest/focus/optional/multiline; SwatchPicker previewing the real header wash","name":"Forms — text field, swatch picker"},{"path":"components/kanban/kanban.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x330","subtitle":"Lane colours are fixed; FROM NOTE is violet, due dates amber, done struck through","name":"Kanban — lanes, columns, task cards"},{"path":"components/layout/layout.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x300","subtitle":"Panel + SectionLabel, dashed EmptyState, Skeleton rows at real row geometry","name":"Layout — panel, empty, loading"},{"path":"components/notes/notes.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x400","subtitle":"Hover-revealed block controls, live task rows, the one shadowed menu, sidebar links","name":"Notes — blocks, tasks, slash menu"},{"path":"components/overlay/overlay.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x420","subtitle":"Modal with one primary action; ⌘K palette with Actions first","name":"Overlay — modal, command palette"},{"path":"components/pipeline/pipeline.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x400","subtitle":"StageColumn, VentureCard identity edges, GateBar, owner chip paired with the founder name","name":"Pipeline — board, venture card, gates"},{"path":"components/venture/venture.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x340","subtitle":"Header wash derived from the venture colour, five-cell gate rail, raised accent tabs","name":"Venture — header, gates, tabs"},{"path":"components/work/work.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x300","subtitle":"Fixed five-column grid, venture dot, lane pill, mono right-aligned date","name":"My work — filters, groups, rows"},{"path":"guidelines/spacing-inuse.card.html","group":"Spacing","viewport":"700x210","subtitle":"12px 13px padding, 8px between cards, 11px above the footer row. Cards nudge 2px right on hover.","name":"Density in use — venture card"},{"path":"guidelines/spacing-radii.card.html","group":"Spacing","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"2px is the default. 3px only for the app frame and the floating menu. No shadows except that menu.","name":"Radii & borders"},{"path":"guidelines/spacing-scale.card.html","group":"Spacing","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"Not a 